 {
  "slug": "文化導覽",
  "title": "文化導覽",
  "summary": "結合不同型態老屋：蕃社30三合院（陳家古厝）、蕃社20土埆厝（House 好事）、蕃社40-1紅磚平房（烘焙小屋），將中港地區蕃社在地文化以徒步方式介紹給來參訪的民眾，以實地的建築觀察與建材討論，搭配",
  "cover": "uploads/2026/10/wp-590c7cfbaa0b9fe0dcf5.jpg",
  "body": "\n<figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-590c7cfbaa0b9fe0dcf5.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-b36aa5142b273108a5e1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-0d6e3db96c71a4c85120.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-5cadde2f1d3ce3ce3f36.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-f602c8a6f8b5d3a67237.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-1462559175d5491785ac.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>結合不同型態老屋：蕃社30三合院（陳家古厝）、蕃社20土埆厝（House 好事）、蕃社40-1紅磚平房（烘焙小屋），將中港地區蕃社在地文化以徒步方式介紹給來參訪的民眾，以實地的建築觀察與建材討論，搭配古厝主人家故事，勾勒出八十年來本地的常民文化足跡。本館開放團體預約導覽以及教育單位地方文化課程合作，歡迎至陳家古厝洽詢。</p>\n\n\n\n<p>歡迎來電 <a href=\"tel:0953118143\">0953118143</a> 預約團體導覽服務\\教學合作 行程與手作體驗介紹</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-41ece4c3b1ad90a9402d.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>在舊城的寧靜巷弄裡，漫步舊城事，六大主題文化之旅</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-3db97fe9cbb2241b92e8.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>點選下圖查閱行程內容，每月不定期開團（5人以上可揪團預約行程）</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>中文、英文、台語、客語，皆可安排專人不同語言導覽解說</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-119abf4630bdb371047a.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-ca49960bc3da3c7941cb.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-82a2aa19ca1962e99cd2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-765e0e242fe5fa3f44b7.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-d90152a88e9c80d33bb5.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-8821e485834a7134f508.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>來趟文化小旅，為生活加入一點手作溫度吧！</p>\n\n\n\n<p>地方職人手作課程讓小旅行更豐盛（5人以上可預約手作課程）</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-000f2ad7e4f7daac45e0.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-5f13a1d05c71a1428c91.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-18d73476361956f5ab6e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-3db324e1a47e01e4aac9.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-0be6f7883e57fdc2bc2d.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-dbfc6d7daa871c1ae50e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-55cab7fe3a702efe57e3.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>走路，是認識一個地方最舒適的方法來一起漫步番社吧！</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><img src=\"uploads/2026/10/wp-d4d70ca7fadcc7adcc71.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n",
